WEBVTT

00:00:30.210 --> 00:00:31.230
Come!

00:00:51.460 --> 00:00:52.950
Bastard!

00:00:58.530 --> 00:01:04.140
Calling forth a Horror and fighting against it at such a young age...

00:01:04.140 --> 00:01:08.410
You have guts, but it's impossible for you.

00:01:08.410 --> 00:01:11.110
I want to become stronger.

00:01:11.110 --> 00:01:14.050
For that sake, I have thrown everything aside.

00:01:14.050 --> 00:01:17.120
Girl, what is your name?

00:01:17.120 --> 00:01:19.750
My name is Kiyome.

00:01:19.750 --> 00:01:27.060
I've heard that Abeno Haruaki banished his granddaughter as filth.

00:01:27.060 --> 00:01:29.230
So that was you.

00:01:29.230 --> 00:01:31.000
You know Grandpa?

00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:33.670
Do you want strength?

00:01:33.670 --> 00:01:36.600
I want the power to defeat these demons!

00:01:36.600 --> 00:01:38.730
Then, follow me.

00:01:44.980 --> 00:01:47.320
Such extraordinarily rare talent.

00:01:47.320 --> 00:01:49.680
And her strong will.

00:01:49.680 --> 00:01:54.120
This girl will definitely become an unparalleled Alchemist.

00:01:54.120 --> 00:01:55.660
However...

00:01:55.660 --> 00:01:57.430
Kiyome.

00:01:57.430 --> 00:02:00.260
Yes, Doushi-<i>sama.</i>

00:02:00.260 --> 00:02:04.530
Seimei... That is your name from now on.

00:02:04.530 --> 00:02:10.110
Seimei. I am honored to receive such a name!

00:02:10.110 --> 00:02:13.510
From this point forth, whether you shine in the light

00:02:13.510 --> 00:02:15.810
or fall to the darkness...

00:02:15.810 --> 00:02:19.200
Everything is up to you.

00:02:31.490 --> 00:02:33.460
Seimei.

00:02:49.680 --> 00:02:57.940
<i>A seal guarded since ancient times</i>

00:02:57.940 --> 00:03:05.930
<i>Now it falls and turns to thorns</i>

00:03:05.930 --> 00:03:13.170
<i>Remnants of resentment brought to</i> <i>life by the darkness of night take breath</i>

00:03:13.170 --> 00:03:22.200
<i>What does that pyre desire</i> <i>and why does it beckon</i>

00:03:23.510 --> 00:03:31.550
<i>The flowers of darkness</i> <i>that fear and hate the light</i>

00:03:31.550 --> 00:03:39.360
<i>Rakshasa, who dances</i> <i>wrapped in a cloak of blood</i>

00:03:39.360 --> 00:03:47.270
<i>Release and call back the golden armor</i>

00:03:47.270 --> 00:03:57.300
<i>The blade, which can cut</i> <i>through inevitable destiny</i>

00:03:58.050 --> 00:04:03.450
<i>Night of the crimson moon</i>

00:04:00.780 --> 00:04:07.970
"GARO: CRIMSON MOON"

00:04:07.970 --> 00:04:12.980
"SHINE AND RUIN"

00:04:13.260 --> 00:04:15.730
Look at how it sparkles!

00:04:15.730 --> 00:04:19.070
It's as if I'm looking at an azure rainbow!

00:04:19.070 --> 00:04:20.400
You got something like that again!

00:04:20.400 --> 00:04:22.570
Something like that?

00:04:22.570 --> 00:04:24.470
You just don't understand.

00:04:24.470 --> 00:04:28.870
This vase is a treasure that traveled from far across the ocean.

00:04:28.870 --> 00:04:30.080
That's not what I'm talking about.

00:04:30.080 --> 00:04:33.920
I'm talking about the <i>way</i> you got that vase.

00:04:33.920 --> 00:04:37.290
I bet you borrowed money from someone again.

00:04:37.290 --> 00:04:39.350
It's really nice.

00:04:39.350 --> 00:04:41.190
So enchanting!

00:04:41.190 --> 00:04:44.660
Things that are only beautiful won't fill the stomach.

00:04:44.660 --> 00:04:48.700
This vase sparkles because of my love for it.

00:04:48.700 --> 00:04:49.600
Goodness!

00:04:49.600 --> 00:04:54.100
Then what about the rice box we can see the bottom of?!

00:04:54.100 --> 00:04:56.630
Come to think of it, I haven't seen Raiko.

00:04:58.940 --> 00:05:02.380
He's gone to the
Watchdog Center in hope of work,

00:05:02.380 --> 00:05:04.110
swallowing his own pride.

00:05:04.110 --> 00:05:08.780
A full-fledged Makai Knight... How pathetic.

00:05:08.780 --> 00:05:11.190
Even though you eat three meals a day here for free!

00:05:11.190 --> 00:05:12.490
Seimei! Kintoki!

00:05:12.490 --> 00:05:14.460
Huh? Raiko-<i>sama</i>?!

00:05:14.460 --> 00:05:16.520
What's wrong?

00:05:16.520 --> 00:05:18.230
A Horror has appeared!

00:05:18.230 --> 00:05:20.060
What kind of Horror is it?

00:05:20.060 --> 00:05:23.920
I wasn't told the details, but it seems to be a troublesome one.

00:05:23.920 --> 00:05:25.670
Inari-<i>sama</i> always...

00:05:25.670 --> 00:05:29.070
Either way, I will defeat the Horror. That's all.

00:05:29.070 --> 00:05:30.910
Seimei, hurry!

00:05:30.910 --> 00:05:32.060
Yes. Yes.

00:05:32.060 --> 00:05:34.880
Jeez, you sound so unmotivated!

00:05:34.880 --> 00:05:36.210
Look! That's the one.

00:05:37.510 --> 00:05:41.470
This thing? How creepy.

00:05:42.980 --> 00:05:45.350
Huh? Even though there's no breeze.

00:05:45.350 --> 00:05:47.380
Raiko-<i>sama</i>, the light!

00:05:48.660 --> 00:05:50.890
The Horror sucks in all light, fades in the darkness,

00:05:50.890 --> 00:05:52.730
and hunts humans.

00:05:52.730 --> 00:05:54.830
We won't be able to see a thing at this rate...

00:05:54.830 --> 00:05:57.900
Then we just have to make light.

00:05:57.900 --> 00:05:58.700
Seimei...

00:05:58.700 --> 00:06:02.570
We'll shine some light with the Golden Armor.

00:06:02.570 --> 00:06:03.900
Raiko!

00:06:04.670 --> 00:06:05.940
Understood!

00:06:14.250 --> 00:06:16.720
Raiko-<i>sama</i>?

00:06:16.720 --> 00:06:20.350
This thing even absorbs the light of the armor!

00:06:22.220 --> 00:06:23.750
Take this!

00:06:26.530 --> 00:06:29.630
It's no use! This thing is going to be trouble.

00:06:29.630 --> 00:06:32.230
Even the light of the armor disappeared...

00:06:32.230 --> 00:06:34.070
Raiko-<i>sama</i>!

00:06:34.940 --> 00:06:37.810
Calm down, Raiko. Even if you cannot see,

00:06:37.810 --> 00:06:41.740
that blindness should heighten your awareness of movement.

00:06:57.990 --> 00:07:00.900
You did it! As expected of you, Raiko-<i>sama</i>!

00:07:00.900 --> 00:07:06.470
I mean, I was a little worried, but it all ended quite easily.

00:07:06.470 --> 00:07:08.230
What's wrong, Raiko?!

00:07:09.640 --> 00:07:12.170
Raiko-<i>sama</i>?

00:07:12.170 --> 00:07:14.510
Seimei, what happened to Raiko-<i>sama</i>?!

00:07:14.510 --> 00:07:18.280
No. I don't know either...

00:07:18.280 --> 00:07:19.680
This is!

00:07:27.360 --> 00:07:33.260
Raiko-<i>sama</i>! Raiko-<i>sama</i>!
Raiko-<i>sama</i>! Raiko-<i>sama</i>!

00:07:39.630 --> 00:07:42.870
He's been sleeping ever since then.

00:07:44.540 --> 00:07:47.340
Is Raiko-<i>sama</i> all right?

00:07:47.340 --> 00:07:49.780
Well, we removed the armor.

00:07:49.780 --> 00:07:52.210
He'll probably open his eyes up eventually.

00:07:52.210 --> 00:07:56.220
Jeez! Seimei, you're so laid back!

00:07:56.220 --> 00:07:57.490
See?

00:07:57.490 --> 00:07:59.190
Raiko-<i>sama</i>!

00:07:59.190 --> 00:08:01.960
I'm hungry. Kintoki, food!

00:08:01.960 --> 00:08:03.360
Yes! Right away!

00:08:03.360 --> 00:08:05.190
Rice. Rice...

00:08:05.190 --> 00:08:06.820
Ouch!

00:08:13.070 --> 00:08:13.900
Seconds!

00:08:13.900 --> 00:08:16.550
Yes, right away!

00:08:16.550 --> 00:08:17.410
Seconds!

00:08:17.410 --> 00:08:18.470
Yes, right away!

00:08:18.470 --> 00:08:19.070
Seconds!

00:08:19.070 --> 00:08:20.560
Yes, right away!

00:08:21.710 --> 00:08:24.740
They say hunger is a good sign of health!

00:08:30.850 --> 00:08:33.490
Raiko-<i>sama</i>, I'm very sorry!

00:08:33.490 --> 00:08:36.090
We are out of steamed rice!

00:08:36.090 --> 00:08:39.060
Our rice grain box is completely empty as well!

00:08:39.060 --> 00:08:40.830
And we don't have money to buy more rice...

00:08:40.830 --> 00:08:44.200
It can't be helped if we don't got any.

00:08:44.200 --> 00:08:45.670
Huh?

00:08:48.700 --> 00:08:50.460
Raiko-<i>sama</i>! Where are you going?

00:08:50.460 --> 00:08:53.740
If we got no money,
I'll just have to go and get some.

00:08:53.740 --> 00:08:55.240
Raiko.

00:08:55.240 --> 00:08:57.040
Don't go outside yet.

00:08:57.040 --> 00:09:00.380
We should monitor you for a little bit. Zaruba is still--

00:09:00.380 --> 00:09:02.020
We don't have any rice.

00:09:02.020 --> 00:09:06.050
Why don't you just stare at that hair ornament and wait quietly.

00:09:06.050 --> 00:09:07.890
Raiko-<i>sama</i>!

00:09:11.390 --> 00:09:14.360
I can't believe you spoke to Seimei that way!

00:09:14.360 --> 00:09:17.970
"Why don't you just stare at that hair ornament and wait quietly."

00:09:17.970 --> 00:09:22.600
It seems like you've finally become a man, Raiko-<i>sama</i>!

00:09:22.600 --> 00:09:24.610
Huh? Raiko-<i>sama</i>?

00:09:24.610 --> 00:09:26.210
Raiko-<i>sama</i>!

00:09:26.210 --> 00:09:29.040
Hey, babe. You look really good.

00:09:29.040 --> 00:09:30.610
B-Babe?

00:09:30.610 --> 00:09:34.250
Where are you going with such a long face?
Come hang out with me!

00:09:34.250 --> 00:09:36.720
My! How rude!

00:09:38.250 --> 00:09:42.090
So snobby. This is why I hate aristocrats.

00:09:42.090 --> 00:09:43.420
Raiko-<i>sama...</i>

00:09:43.420 --> 00:09:48.460
Right? They really want to play around, but they lie to themselves.

00:09:48.460 --> 00:09:50.830
Jeez, they're really troublesome.

00:09:50.830 --> 00:09:53.000
What?! Hey, what did you just say!

00:09:53.000 --> 00:09:55.600
I'm telling you that you're blind!

00:09:55.600 --> 00:09:56.970
Don't joke around!

00:09:56.970 --> 00:09:59.340
I called you blind cause you're blind.

00:09:59.340 --> 00:10:00.580
You bastard!

00:10:00.580 --> 00:10:04.580
They're fighting in the middle of the road. How bothersome.

00:10:04.580 --> 00:10:09.180
How bothersome. All right! I'll take care of it.

00:10:10.250 --> 00:10:15.490
Yes, he's a bit rougher, but that part of him is the same...

00:10:15.490 --> 00:10:16.980
I think?

00:10:19.790 --> 00:10:20.660
Hey, what's wrong?

00:10:20.660 --> 00:10:22.960
Forgive us!

00:10:22.960 --> 00:10:26.670
Why? Because the Madou Ring turned black?

00:10:26.670 --> 00:10:30.610
You said the Horror stole the armor's light.

00:10:30.610 --> 00:10:33.940
This is an effect of an armor clad in darkness.

00:10:33.940 --> 00:10:38.110
The darkness collected in his armor is affecting him badly.

00:10:38.110 --> 00:10:41.820
Are you saying that cleansing the Madou Ring is not enough?

00:10:41.820 --> 00:10:44.620
You must banish the darkness from the armor

00:10:44.620 --> 00:10:47.360
or history will only repeat.

00:10:47.360 --> 00:10:50.880
At this rate, the owner will lose his sanity as well.

00:10:52.390 --> 00:10:55.890
This situation is quite severe.

00:11:06.970 --> 00:11:10.040
Come closer now.

00:11:10.040 --> 00:11:13.610
No one is watching.
It will be fine! It will be fine!

00:11:13.610 --> 00:11:16.180
We cannot. We cannot.

00:11:16.180 --> 00:11:19.210
Masamune-<i>sama</i>, you have a wife.

00:11:19.210 --> 00:11:22.850
It was my mistake to marry a woman

00:11:22.850 --> 00:11:26.010
who only criticizes and complains when she sees my face.

00:11:27.690 --> 00:11:30.160
I plan to kick her out!

00:11:30.160 --> 00:11:33.160
Come, how about starting as a concubine?

00:11:33.160 --> 00:11:35.900
--Well? Well?
--Wait, no...

00:11:35.900 --> 00:11:37.970
I saw. I saw it all!

00:11:37.970 --> 00:11:40.070
Who is there? You scoundrel!

00:11:40.070 --> 00:11:43.160
Masamune-<i>sama</i>, you're quite the player!

00:11:44.870 --> 00:11:48.210
You! What are you doing in a place like that?!

00:11:48.210 --> 00:11:49.710
H-H-Hurry up and leave!

00:11:49.710 --> 00:11:52.480
To think the hen-pecked husband, Masamune-<i>sama,</i>

00:11:52.480 --> 00:11:55.550
would kick out his own wife.

00:11:55.550 --> 00:12:00.750
I wonder what will happen if your wife hears about this?

00:12:01.990 --> 00:12:05.490
Wh-Wh-Wh-What?
You, come here, come here.

00:12:05.490 --> 00:12:08.060
Let us talk this over.

00:12:08.060 --> 00:12:13.400
Come, come. Come closer. Please!

00:12:16.600 --> 00:12:21.240
This is what happens when I get a little serious!

00:12:21.240 --> 00:12:23.580
That was blackmail!

00:12:23.580 --> 00:12:28.100
What? Listen. I didn't ask for any money, even once.

00:12:28.100 --> 00:12:31.120
Masamune-<i>sama</i> gave us money on his own.

00:12:31.120 --> 00:12:34.090
Well, that's true...

00:12:34.090 --> 00:12:36.460
Oh, Seimei is home, too.

00:12:36.460 --> 00:12:40.230
Take a look! We can eat as much rice or food as we want!

00:12:40.230 --> 00:12:42.750
Go buy whatever you want!

00:12:46.270 --> 00:12:50.400
If he continues to become a Raiko-<i>sama</i> I do not know...

00:12:53.120 --> 00:12:56.540
It seems Raiko is still being affected by the Horror.

00:12:56.540 --> 00:12:59.380
Then, we should exorcise it!

00:12:59.380 --> 00:13:01.580
It's not that easy.

00:13:05.090 --> 00:13:09.990
Hey, Kintoki. We'll have a whole fish for breakfast tomorrow!

00:13:09.990 --> 00:13:10.680
Raiko.

00:13:10.680 --> 00:13:12.160
Hm?

00:13:13.160 --> 00:13:15.430
Seimei, what's the meaning of this?!

00:13:15.430 --> 00:13:16.900
Why did you do that?

00:13:16.900 --> 00:13:21.270
Dammit! I can't move! It's tightening around me!

00:13:21.270 --> 00:13:26.010
Kintoki, at this rate, Raiko will lose himself.

00:13:26.010 --> 00:13:27.580
No way...

00:13:27.580 --> 00:13:29.610
I leave Raiko to you.

00:13:29.610 --> 00:13:31.810
Watch him if you don't want him to die.

00:13:33.810 --> 00:13:34.480
Hey!

00:13:34.480 --> 00:13:36.120
Untie these ropes!

00:13:36.120 --> 00:13:38.520
I can't eat like this!

00:13:38.520 --> 00:13:40.860
Hey! You! Seimei!

00:13:40.860 --> 00:13:43.260
Kintoki, grab that sword for me.

00:13:47.460 --> 00:13:50.870
What a rare guest.

00:13:50.870 --> 00:13:54.970
What business does an excommunicated student have here?

00:13:54.970 --> 00:13:58.840
I have no business with you, Ashiya Douman.

00:13:58.840 --> 00:14:02.680
I'll have you speak with me first.

00:14:02.680 --> 00:14:07.010
I may have been excommunicated, but I've known him a long time.

00:14:07.010 --> 00:14:08.450
Stand down.

00:14:09.720 --> 00:14:13.120
As usual, such a shameless woman.

00:14:13.120 --> 00:14:17.720
A pitiful woman who was tossed away not only once, but twice.

00:14:20.730 --> 00:14:23.630
Were you lured here by the full moon?

00:14:23.630 --> 00:14:26.830
No! I have come to ask you something.

00:14:26.830 --> 00:14:28.720
What is it?

00:14:28.720 --> 00:14:32.570
How can I exorcise the darkness that has seeped into armor?

00:14:34.910 --> 00:14:38.050
You came to beg for help?

00:14:38.050 --> 00:14:40.880
If he is affected by the darkness,

00:14:40.880 --> 00:14:44.720
he can just accept it and become one with it.

00:14:44.720 --> 00:14:49.090
I will not allow him to fall into the darkness!

00:14:49.090 --> 00:14:51.220
It seems I have wasted my time.

00:14:53.890 --> 00:14:56.330
There are other ways.

00:14:56.330 --> 00:14:59.270
What kind? What should I do?!

00:14:59.270 --> 00:15:03.270
I see. The one named Raiko...

00:15:03.270 --> 00:15:04.610
Don't say stupid things!

00:15:04.610 --> 00:15:08.940
I see, so that man is your light.

00:15:08.940 --> 00:15:13.610
It has been a long time since we faced each other like this.

00:15:13.610 --> 00:15:17.110
I want to have some fun.

00:15:20.890 --> 00:15:23.790
You've become even more of a woman.

00:15:23.790 --> 00:15:29.360
Do what you like, just like you have in the past.

00:15:29.360 --> 00:15:35.370
You are one of the few who can accept both light and darkness.

00:15:35.370 --> 00:15:40.370
So, you just need to absorb the darkness into yourself and seal it.

00:15:40.370 --> 00:15:42.610
In myself?

00:15:42.610 --> 00:15:45.310
I will give you the spell.

00:15:45.310 --> 00:15:52.790
Pull that darkness into yourself, just as your mother did.

00:15:52.790 --> 00:15:55.420
Do you know why I used "star" and "light"

00:15:55.420 --> 00:15:59.460
to give you the name of Seimei?

00:15:59.460 --> 00:16:05.330
A single light deepens the darkness that surrounds it.

00:16:05.330 --> 00:16:13.010
Though you will be able to remove the darkness from the armor,

00:16:13.010 --> 00:16:16.240
that darkness within you will never disappear.

00:16:22.080 --> 00:16:26.280
Raiko-<i>sama</i>, please calm down a little!

00:16:28.090 --> 00:16:29.360
Raiko-<i>sama.</i>

00:16:29.360 --> 00:16:33.960
Will I really ever be able to see the Raiko-<i>sama</i> I know again?

00:16:33.960 --> 00:16:35.360
Huh?

00:16:42.600 --> 00:16:44.540
Why did you do that?

00:16:44.540 --> 00:16:47.310
We should take this chance to defeat Raiko!

00:16:47.310 --> 00:16:51.850
Raiko does not matter. I wish to test Seimei.

00:16:51.850 --> 00:16:53.780
Seimei? Why?

00:16:53.780 --> 00:16:59.690
You still have not noticed the light and dark that clash within her?

00:16:59.690 --> 00:17:04.190
I will not accept even a single shining star.

00:17:04.190 --> 00:17:08.800
This world does not need light.

00:17:08.800 --> 00:17:11.830
Kintoki! Let's save Raiko!

00:17:11.830 --> 00:17:13.230
Kintoki?

00:17:13.230 --> 00:17:18.640
Kintoki! Are you all right?
Hang in there, Kintoki!

00:17:18.640 --> 00:17:19.810
Ouch...

00:17:19.810 --> 00:17:22.640
What's going on? What happened?

00:17:22.640 --> 00:17:24.750
Seimei...

00:17:24.750 --> 00:17:26.480
Such a huge bump!

00:17:26.480 --> 00:17:28.080
So mean!

00:17:28.080 --> 00:17:31.580
Oh, that's right! It's terrible! Raiko-<i>sama</i>!

00:17:33.020 --> 00:17:34.550
Find Raiko!

00:17:37.590 --> 00:17:39.730
Okay! Let's go, Kintoki!

00:17:39.730 --> 00:17:41.030
Understood!

00:17:41.030 --> 00:17:42.650
Raiko-<i>sama</i>!

00:17:58.380 --> 00:18:03.410
I can't believe I punched Kintoki.
What's happened to me?!

00:18:10.620 --> 00:18:13.560
What a pathetic sight.

00:18:13.560 --> 00:18:16.120
Do you want to escape the suffering?

00:18:17.970 --> 00:18:20.230
You're like a beast.

00:18:20.230 --> 00:18:26.270
I will end your pain before you get consumed by the darkness.

00:18:27.880 --> 00:18:30.110
Raiko! Fall to darkness!

00:18:34.650 --> 00:18:38.290
I will give that woman the darkness of despair.

00:18:38.290 --> 00:18:43.250
The one who inherited the name of Ashiya Douman, is me!

00:18:44.930 --> 00:18:49.090
Hate! Anger! Drown in the darkness!

00:18:53.570 --> 00:18:55.300
You came, Seimei.

00:18:55.300 --> 00:18:56.840
Stop, Douman.

00:18:56.840 --> 00:19:01.240
Seimei, you are too late!
He is already in the darkness.

00:19:01.240 --> 00:19:03.640
Raiko! Summon your armor!

00:19:06.790 --> 00:19:08.850
Raiko-<i>sama</i>!

00:19:08.850 --> 00:19:10.320
Raiko...

00:19:12.920 --> 00:19:15.190
The armor... Seimei...

00:19:17.460 --> 00:19:20.590
He looks more like a dark knight.

00:19:20.590 --> 00:19:22.360
How foolish, Seimei.

00:19:22.360 --> 00:19:25.000
Once he wears his armor,

00:19:25.000 --> 00:19:28.090
he will quickly drown and die in the darkness.

00:19:32.440 --> 00:19:34.980
There is no need for me to finish him.

00:19:34.980 --> 00:19:39.810
All that is left is the darkness of despair.

00:19:39.810 --> 00:19:41.680
Hey, Seimei.

00:19:41.680 --> 00:19:44.380
Is Raiko-<i>sama</i> going to die?

00:19:46.190 --> 00:19:50.720
I won't let him die, even if it means my life!

00:19:50.720 --> 00:19:53.860
Seimei. Seimei!

00:19:53.860 --> 00:19:55.730
Listen to me, Zaruba!

00:19:55.730 --> 00:20:00.570
I will absorb the darkness that has seeped into the armor.

00:20:00.570 --> 00:20:03.760
There is no other way to save Raiko.

00:20:03.760 --> 00:20:05.240
Seimei!

00:20:05.240 --> 00:20:07.970
Raiko. Don't die!

00:20:18.490 --> 00:20:25.330
The things I love sparkle with light!

00:20:25.330 --> 00:20:32.100
That's why, you must, too.
Raiko, you have to...

00:20:33.030 --> 00:20:36.370
Raiko...

00:20:36.370 --> 00:20:37.570
Come back!

00:20:41.610 --> 00:20:43.080
The light.

00:20:52.020 --> 00:21:01.600
Seimei! Raiko-<i>sama</i>!

00:20:55.060 --> 00:21:01.600
Seimei! Raiko-<i>sama</i>!

00:21:01.600 --> 00:21:04.950
--Seimei... Raiko-<i>sama...</i>
--I caused you trouble.

00:21:04.950 --> 00:21:07.590
Yes, a little.

00:21:14.910 --> 00:21:17.240
Raiko-<i>sama.</i>

00:21:17.240 --> 00:21:21.780
Huh? Kintoki, why am I sleeping here?

00:21:21.780 --> 00:21:24.050
Raiko-<i>sama</i>!

00:21:24.050 --> 00:21:28.620
What is it, Kintoki?
You're acting strange. Crying like that.

00:21:28.620 --> 00:21:33.790
Men shouldn't show tears in any situation.

00:21:35.300 --> 00:21:38.330
Seimei, don't forget.

00:21:38.330 --> 00:21:42.300
Though you will be able to remove the darkness from the armor,

00:21:42.300 --> 00:21:48.610
that darkness within you will never disappear.

00:21:48.610 --> 00:21:51.650
Huh? Seimei, what happened to your shoulder?

00:21:51.650 --> 00:21:54.680
Oh, I was bitten by a dog.

00:21:54.680 --> 00:21:57.820
Dog?! You, bitten by a dog?

00:21:57.820 --> 00:22:01.920
It was black and <i>so</i> uncute.

00:22:01.920 --> 00:22:04.960
A black dog, huh? Seems kind of scary.

00:22:04.960 --> 00:22:09.300
Seimei! Today we'll have a whole fish for breakfast!

00:22:09.300 --> 00:22:10.600
I'm so hungry!

00:22:10.600 --> 00:22:12.500
Goodness, Raiko-<i>sama</i>!

00:22:12.500 --> 00:22:14.300
Oh, looks good!

00:22:14.300 --> 00:22:15.960
Right? Right?

00:22:31.150 --> 00:22:38.130
<i>Illusions of darkness</i> <i>reflect where there is light</i>

00:22:38.130 --> 00:22:45.070
<i>The way of the current world is so fleeting</i>

00:22:45.070 --> 00:22:52.240
<i>The fluttering butterfly that</i> <i>is drowning within your dreams</i>

00:22:52.240 --> 00:22:59.230
<i>Will only disappear if you</i> <i>reach out gently to touch it</i>

00:22:59.230 --> 00:23:02.750
<i>The dancing of the glowing flames (sweetly)</i>

00:23:02.750 --> 00:23:06.220
<i>The flower-like music (far away)</i>

00:23:06.220 --> 00:23:09.360
<i>The elegance of the moon</i>

00:23:09.360 --> 00:23:11.990
<i>Warmth that does not return (gently)</i>

00:23:11.990 --> 00:23:16.750
<i>Hold me (look for the light of twilight)</i>

00:23:16.750 --> 00:23:23.750
<i>Dance up high, passing</i> <i>everything down the family crest</i>

00:23:23.750 --> 00:23:30.110
<i>The heart you want to protect</i> <i>even to the end of all memory</i>

00:23:30.110 --> 00:23:37.380
<i>Dance and bloom proudly,</i> <i>these lights that call each other</i>

00:23:37.380 --> 00:23:40.690
<i>Will overlap and shine again</i>

00:23:40.690 --> 00:23:48.390
<i>These crimson flowers</i> <i>of oath that drift to and fro</i>

00:23:50.990 --> 00:24:00.990
"Next Episode: 1/10TH"

00:23:52.950 --> 00:23:56.720
If your perspective changes, so does your view of the world around you.

00:23:56.720 --> 00:23:58.660
And, of course, your friends.
